{
  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1740461930_2238298_12405a3a3e481e67aef925d3adb6971c.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><p data-end=\"264\" data-start=\"64\"><strong data-end=\"89\" data-start=\"64\">• Brand Introduction:</strong><br data-end=\"92\" data-start=\"89\">Supaw is a Melbourne-based pet bakery specialising in making healthy, pet-diet-friendly cakes and treats to help pet parents celebrate their furry friends' special moments.</p><p data-end=\"529\" data-start=\"266\"><strong data-end=\"292\" data-start=\"266\">• Product Description:</strong><br data-end=\"295\" data-start=\"292\">Our range includes meaty celebration cakes, freeze-dried cupcakes, donuts, and cookies — all made with high-quality ingredients like chicken, beef, kangaroo, and natural veggie colours. Designed to be both delicious and safe for pets.</p><p data-end=\"839\" data-start=\"531\"><strong data-end=\"564\" data-start=\"531\">• USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong><br data-end=\"567\" data-start=\"564\">Our healthy cakes and treats are loved by a loyal customer base. Every product is developed with pets’ wellbeing in mind — free from grains, dairy, sugar, and artificial ingredients. Our freeze-dried range is shelf-stable, lightweight, and perfect for nationwide shipping.</p><p data-end=\"893\" data-start=\"841\"><strong data-end=\"861\" data-start=\"841\">• Payment Terms:</strong><br data-end=\"864\" data-start=\"861\">Bank Transfer or Store Credit</p><p data-end=\"1169\" data-start=\"895\"><strong data-end=\"919\" data-start=\"895\">• Other Information:</strong><br data-end=\"922\" data-start=\"919\">We welcome pet bloggers, content creators, and pet store owners to join our affiliate program. Earn commission while promoting a local, award-winning brand that pet lovers trust. Tailored marketing materials and samples are available upon request.</p></div>",
